      "last_verified_at": "2026-11-12T00:00:00Z",
      "notes": "Consolidated Digital Lending Directions 2025 formally repealing and subsuming the 2022 Digital Lending Guidelines (RBI/2022-23/111) and 2023 DLG circulars. Mandates 5% DLG portfolio cap, CIMS public DLA directory, multi-lender transparent view, direct bank account disbursal, upfront KFS, look-up cooling-off window (>=3 days for loans >=7 days, 1 day for <7 days without penalty), and strict prohibitions on DLA access to contacts, call logs, and media."
    },
