      "last_verified_at": "2026-11-12T00:00:00Z",
      "notes": "Master Direction for PSOs prescribing baseline governance, risk management, and cybersecurity controls. Key mandates include Clause 14 mandatory 6-hour incident reporting to CERT-In and RBI; Board-approved Cyber Crisis Management Plan (CCMP); periodic VAPT audits; Multi-Factor Authentication (MFA) for digital payment access; and supply-chain / third-party vendor risk controls."
